# Which GPU Hyprland renders on.
#
# Deliberately unset in the repo. This file is tracked, so any value committed
# here is inherited by every machine that clones it — and a pin to card paths
# that do not exist locally is worse than no pin at all: aquamarine fails to
# create a DRI screen, falls back to kms_swrast, and then dies on
# DRM_IOCTL_MODE_CREATE_DUMB.
#
# install.sh detects the GPUs on the machine it runs on and rewrites this file:
# on a multi-GPU box it writes the real ordering, integrated first, so the
# desktop does not end up rendering on a discrete card. On a single-GPU box
# there is nothing to choose between and it stays commented out.
#
# Card numbering is not stable across boots. If the session ever comes up on
# the wrong GPU, re-run install.sh or use a stable name from /dev/dri/by-path/.
#
# export AQ_DRM_DEVICES="/dev/dri/card1:/dev/dri/card0"
